OL,3,AAnthropic shares expected to jump at
OL,4,Astart of trading as AI firm makes stock
OL,5,Amarket debut
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe flotation is being seen as a
OL,8,Fcrucial test for the AI sector, with
OL,9,FAnthropic the first purely AI-focused
OL,10,Ffirm to sell shares publicly
OL,12,FThe seven founders who set up Anthropic
OL,13,Fin 2021 will become multi-billionaires
OL,14,F- we've looked at why private companies
OL,15,Fdecide to sell shares publicly here
